// RULE (Steve 10/11/2026): rep reports a cancellation / a saved customer -> WhatsApp to Coral (0584896222) with the customer row from the דוח מכר; "שיקפתי" -> only a reply that the שיקופים bot checks recordings by itself and updates if none is found. Rep first name only. Do not remove.
